  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aluga Maize, Soya Beans, and Sunflower Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Crops Maize Beneficiaries: 621 small holder farmers of whom 439 are women. Project funds will be used for production and quality improvements at farm level by providing farmers with more access to farm inputs. Funds will also be used to; acquire a tractor to help farmer members with land opening; procure processing equipment for value addition; construct a mill house; and procure a truck to be used to collect produce from farmers to bulking centers and processed products to markets. Finally, grant funds will be used to improve the working capital position of the cooperative.</narrative>
  </description>
